     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Adjective with the definite article",
     "texto": [
      "With **der/die/das**, the adjective usually ends in **-e** only in the nominative singular and in the feminine/neuter accusative. In the other cases, including the nominative plural, it ends in **-en**: **der neue Film**, **die neuen Filme**.",
      "In the masculine and neuter genitive the noun usually takes **-(e)s** and the adjective **-en**: **des neuen Films**."
     ],
